    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/apartment-37-barons-hall-park-barons-hall-balbriggan-dublin-k32-a386\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 37 Barons Hall Park, Balbriggan.\r\n\r\nThis two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment offers modern living in the vibrant community of Balbriggan, Dublin. The building is characterised by its contemporary design, with a well-maintained communal exterior that offers a warm welcome to residents and visitors. Enter through the shared hallway, which also conveniently accommodates bicycle storage, enhancing the property's practicality.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the apartment, the layout immediately impresses with its spaciousness. The living area is bright and airy, featuring a large window that welcomes ample natural light. The adjoining kitchen is fitted with sleek cabinetry, and appliances. The design maximises space and functionality, providing an ideal setting for both relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom, a comfortable and serene space, includes fitted wardrobes that offer ample storage solutions. The ensuite bathroom is a practical addition for convenience and privacy. The second bedroom is equally inviting, well-sized, and can easily function as a guest room or home office. The main bathroom is finished to a high standard, contributing to the overall appeal and functionality of the property.\r\n\r\nThe apartment’s location is ideal for those seeking convenience and connectivity. Positioned just a short distance from local schools, shops, and Balbriggan’s vibrant town centre, residents will appreciate the proximity to essential amenities. Excellent transport links are nearby, including bus services and the Balbriggan train station, which lies within a 15-minute stroll, providing access to Dublin city and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis property perfectly suits first-time buyers, young , or investors seeking a modern home with practical features. With its contemporary design, convenient location, and thoughtful layout, Apartment 37 Barons Hall Park presents an attractive opportunity in a thriving community."
      },
